flowchart TB
accTitle: Separate reporting reads from transactional writes
accDescr: After a validated migration, transactions use the RDS MySQL primary while reporting uses provisioned read replicas with acceptable lag.
W[Transactional application]:::inputData --> P[(RDS MySQL Multi-AZ<br/>Primary endpoint)]:::storage
R[Month-end reporting]:::inputData --> A[(Read replica A)]:::storage
R --> B[(Read replica B)]:::storage
P -. asynchronous replication .-> A
P -. asynchronous replication .-> B
N[Provision before peak<br/>Check readiness and lag]:::reference -.-> R
